abstract: >-
  An interactive commercial real estate studio that connects a procedural
  six-shop Japanese plaza with hypothetical premises, leases, a rent roll,
  and a landlord renewal-versus-re-leasing cash-flow activity. The independent
  project supports FIN 355 instruction at California State University, Fullerton.
